=== Test 35: NOT around a correlated scalar subquery on the left ===
SUM(i_id) per i_k: (10,1),(30,3). Orders 2 and 4 have no inner rows,
order 3 a NULL o_k. Only order 1 qualifies (NOT 1>1)
== Query ==
SELECT o_id, SUM(o_amt)
FROM nq_outer
WHERE NOT ((SELECT SUM(i_id) FROM nq_inner WHERE i_k = o_k) > o_id)
GROUP BY o_id;

