==========




=== Test 36: Correlated COUNT subquery, outer keys without inner rows ===
COUNT(*) per i_k: (10,1),(NULL,1),(30,1). Orders 2 and 4 have no inner
rows and order 3 a NULL o_k, so their COUNT is 0: orders 2, 3 and 4
== Query ==
SELECT o_id, SUM(o_amt)
FROM nq_outer
WHERE o_id > (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM nq_inner WHERE i_k = o_k)
GROUP BY o_id;

Number of output lines, including header: 4

