==========




=== Test 37: NOT around a correlated COUNT subquery on the left ===
COUNT(l_id) where qty>20: (3,2),(5,2), and 0 for orders 1, 2 and 4.
No count reaches o_custkey, so every order qualifies
== Query ==
SELECT o_id, SUM(o_total)
FROM orders
WHERE NOT ((SELECT COUNT(l_id) FROM lineitem WHERE l_orderkey = o_id AND l_quantity > 20) >= o_custkey)
GROUP BY o_id;

Number of output lines, including header: 6

