=== Test 38: Scalar subquery selecting two columns (rejected) ===
A scalar subquery selects 2 columns, but it is compared as one value.
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: A scalar subquery must select exactly one column.

=== Test 39: IN subquery selecting two columns (rejected) ===
An IN subquery selects 2 columns, but IN compares one value with each of its rows.
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: An IN subquery must select exactly one column.

=== Test 40: Scalar subquery returning five rows (rejected) ===
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: A scalar subquery returned more than one row.

=== Test 41: EXISTS retains a filter on a same-named correlation key ===
Expected: id=7, total=70
== Query ==
SELECT o.id, SUM(o.amount) AS total
FROM i1_outer AS o
WHERE EXISTS (
  SELECT i.val FROM i1_inner AS i
  WHERE i.id = o.id AND i.id = 7
)
GROUP BY o.id;

Number of output lines, including header: 2

== Diff ==
==========




